	"FriendlyName": "OpenSplat4D",
	"Description": "4D Gaussian Splatting (4DGS) + 3DGS dual-mode rendering plugin for Unreal Engine 5.5~6.0. Renders time-varying Gaussian point clouds captured/trained by 4DGS pipelines, coexists with the static 3DGS mode as switchable dual modes.",
	"Category": "Rendering",
	"CreatedBy": "OpenSplat4D",
